\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The shared W-TinyLFU simulator pipeline used for both estimators: a doorkeeper pre-filter, a shadow-queue admission test comparing candidate versus victim frequency, and a segmented LRU main region with an admission window. The baseline uses one global-reset Count-Min sketch; the proposed estimator replaces it with three CoV-routed sketch tiers (volatile / default / stable) fed by a shadow-metadata LRU that tracks each key's inter-arrival-gap statistics.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{2}{The shared W-TinyLFU simulator pipeline used for both estimators: a doorkeeper pre-filter, a shadow-queue admission test comparing candidate versus victim frequency, and a segmented LRU main region with an admission window. The baseline uses one global-reset Count-Min sketch; the proposed estimator replaces it with three CoV-routed sketch tiers (volatile / default / stable) fed by a shadow-metadata LRU that tracks each key's inter-arrival-gap statistics}{figure.1}{}}
